{"book":"Judges","chapter":17,"entries":[{"id":6981,"title":"Judges 17:1","segments":["¶And there was a man of mount Ephraim, whose name [was] Micah."],"ref":"Judges 17:1","verse":1,"words":[{"text":"¶And there was a man","strong":"H376"},{"text":" of mount","strong":"H2022"},{"text":" Ephraim","strong":"H669"},{"text":", whose name","strong":"H8034"},{"text":" [was] Micah","strong":"H4321"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6982,"title":"Judges 17:2","segments":["And he said unto his mother, The eleven hundred [shekels] of silver that were taken from thee, about which thou cursedst, and spakest of also in mine ears, behold, the silver [is] with me; I took it. And his mother said, Blessed [be thou] of the LORD, my son."],"ref":"Judges 17:2","verse":2,"words":[{"text":"And he said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto his mother","strong":"H517"},{"text":", The eleven hundred","strong":"H505"},{"text":"","strong":"H3967"},{"text":" [shekels] of silver","strong":"H3701"},{"text":" that were taken","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" from thee, about which thou cursedst","strong":"H422"},{"text":", and spakest","strong":"H559"},{"text":" of also in mine ears","strong":"H241"},{"text":", behold, the silver","strong":"H3701"},{"text":" [is] with me; I took","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" it. And his mother","strong":"H517"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Blessed","strong":"H1288"},{"text":" [be thou] of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", my son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6983,"title":"Judges 17:3","segments":["And when he had restored the eleven hundred [shekels] of silver to his mother, his mother said, I had wholly dedicated the silver unto the LORD from my hand for my son, to make a graven image and a molten image: now therefore I will restore it unto thee."],"ref":"Judges 17:3","verse":3,"words":[{"text":"And when he had restored","strong":"H7725"},{"text":" the eleven hundred","strong":"H505"},{"text":"","strong":"H3967"},{"text":" [shekels] of silver","strong":"H3